---
description: Core libraries and frameworks used in napx-pms
globs:
alwaysApply: agent
---

- Use `@nestjs/common` (API) and Next.js built-in utilities (frontend) for common utilities.
- Use React hooks (useState, useContext) for client state and Next.js server components for server state for state management.
- Use Tailwind CSS 4, ShadCN UI for styling; prefer utility classes over custom CSS.
- Use ShadCN UI for UI components; check existing components before creating new ones.
